 a friend of mine, Mira, of her VTuber avatar. Something cute in your style would be perfect. Pose of your choice. I look forward to seeing what you create.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-UH7oz4bytlSst2MQK8017CCKrK1Vm9H?usp=drive_link", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@mint_chocoooo/works/13", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/d40fd5e8/uploads/origins/cf748abe-ee0c-44c2-ba36-86936eae0cb3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fa3845bc7c441f211b8dc77ec46bb03d", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d40fd5e8/uploads/origins/cf748abe-ee0c-44c2-ba36-86936eae0cb3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fa3845bc7c441f211b8dc77ec46bb03d, https://si.imgix.net/d40fd5e8/uploads/origins/cf748abe-ee0c-44c2-ba36-86936eae0cb3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=05609ac18cdb526d50533bbe4352a4b6 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d40fd5e8/uploads/origins/cf748abe-ee0c-44c2-ba36-86936eae0cb3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7b0b64d4dac82e5c0492450ff14db735 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！あなたの画風がとても好きなので、私のカメの女の子を描いていただけませんか？\n\n彼女は家の中でテレビゲームをしたり、アニメを見たり、お菓子を食べるのが好きです！アコースティックギターを弾くのも好きです！\n\nポーズやシナリオは特に考えていません！よろしくお願いします！\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/QvGTwZi", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@mint_chocoooo/works/12", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/1258c0f8/uploads/origins/c9ac4938-2a97-470c-b37d-868d6827303a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=23a7bf32bbbf44368ea384d3c0669e39", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1258c0f8/uploads/origins/c9ac4938-2a97-470c-b37d-868d6827303a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=23a7bf32bbbf44368ea384d3c0669e39, https://si.imgix.net/1258c0f8/uploads/origins/c9ac4938-2a97-470c-b37d-868d6827303a?bg=%23fff&auto